     "end": 487
    },
    "digest": "5e925cd3c17f70fab7eb159b9be15350b7d2a6ed6f22ac66976e4af8ba03ffd0"
   },
   {
    "row": 18,
    "column": 0,
    "colspan": 5,
    "rowspan": 1,
    "text": "that our ReSearch results differ from the original paper due to discrepancies in training datasets.",
    "coordinates": null,
    "span": {
     "start": 487,
     "end": 586
    },
    "digest": "04091d6c5515dd8738696e6f01356ffc2d5ce66615b9184746ff1eaf9192fb05"
   },
   {
    "row": 19,
    "column": 0,
    "colspan": 5,
    "rowspan": 1,
    "text": "As demonstrated in the table, our proposed SEM consistently demonstrates superior performance",
    "coordinates": null,
    "span": {
     "start": 586,
     "end": 679
    },
    "digest": "7cfdcc81bb592c492884606e51b8c4489440e9a8ef546361218898fd7542ddbd"
   },
   {
    "row": 20,
    "column": 0,
    "colspan": 5,
    "rowspan": 1,
    "text": "across all evaluated benchmarks. On the HotpotQA dataset, our Qwen2.5-7B-Instruct model trained",
    "coordinates": null,
    "span": {
     "start": 679,
     "end": 774
    },
    "digest": "e37c76c80b6d1329d17b16416da5701d1dd999ca35094ba10e0424dd8c39cd36"
   },
   {
    "row": 21,
    "column": 0,
    "colspan": 5,
    "rowspan": 1,
    "text": "under SEM achieves an Exact Match (EM) score of 35.84, significantly outperforming the Naive RAG",
    "coordinates": null,
    "span": {
     "start": 774,
     "end": 870
    },
    "digest": "8778d1e85baeafeb7d821bec7d8adac293fdc6ec15ee04a164655d4745d538e2"
